#: ../../source/reference/formats.rst:6
msgid "Supported Formats"
msgstr "Studd snið"

#: ../../source/reference/formats.rst:8
msgid ""
"``snapper`` classifies text into *prose regions* (reflowed at sentence "
"boundaries), *structure regions* (passed through unchanged), and *code "
"regions* (fenced or delimited source blocks). Code regions keep fence/open/"
"close lines as structure; the body reflows comment lines when ``[code."
"<lang>]`` is configured, and may run an external formatter when ``--format-"
"code`` is set. The classification depends on the format."
msgstr ""

