#: ../../source/reference/formats.rst:316
msgid ""
"Sentence punctuation inside quotes or parentheses does not trigger a false "
"split when the next word starts lowercase. For example, ``He said \"wow!\" "
"and left.`` stays on one line because ``\"!\"`` followed by lowercase "
"``and`` signals a continuation, not a new sentence. Patterns handled: ``!"
"\"``, ``?\"``, ``.\"``, ``!)``, ``?)``, ``.)``, and similar combinations "
"with single quotes or brackets."
msgstr ""

